# Force binary handling for document and image assets.
#
# The repo has core.autocrlf=true (set by Git for Windows). Git can classify
# a PDF as text if the heuristic doesn't find enough NUL bytes early on, and
# then silently rewrites every LF to CRLF. For a PDF that is fatal: the xref
# byte offsets no longer point at the right places and the file fails to open.
# Marking these explicitly means no line-ending conversion is ever applied,
# regardless of the local autocrlf setting.

*.pdf   binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
